opt-out-design.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1149, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:04:33\", \"token_count\": 342, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-64\\n\\n# Slack Thread: Telemetry Opt-Out Verification\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-08-24\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-24 13:31] Diana**: Finished the network trace tests. With the flag set to `false`, there is zero outbound traffic to the telemetry endpoints.\\n\\n**[2026-08-24 13:45] Bob**: Excellent. PR #91 is merged and verified.\\n\\n**[2026-08-24 13:46] Alice**: Thanks Diana. This is a big one for our compliance audit.\\n\\n**[2026-08-24 13:49] Evan**: I've updated the Docker image to include the environment variable support.\\n\\n**[2026-08-24 13:56] Diana**: I also tested the GUI toggle. It correctly updates the config file and requires a restart to take effect, which is exactly what we wanted.\\n\\n**[2026-08-24 13:57] Alice**: Closing. Great work everyone. :lock:\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 64 slack thread telemetri opt out verif channel cipherdoc date 2026 08 24 2026 08 24 13 31 diana finish the network trace test with the flag set to fals there is zero outbound traffic to the telemetri endpoint 2026 08 24 13 45 bob excel pr 91 is merg and verifi 2026 08 24 13 46 alic thank diana this is a big one for our complianc audit 2026 08 24 13 49 evan i ve updat the docker imag to includ the environ variabl support 2026 08 24 13 56 diana i also test the gui toggl it correct updat the config file and requir a restart to take effect which is exact what we want 2026 08 24 13 57 alic close great work everyon lock\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e921a8ac8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/so