5:16] Diana**: Okay, I'll verify that with a packet capture tomorrow.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 63 slack thread telemetri opt out flag channel cipherdoc date 2026 08 22 2026 08 22 14 12 bob the telemetri _ enabl flag is now fulli integr into the cli and the api default is set to true but it s easili overridden in config yaml 2026 08 22 14 37 evan can we also support an environ variabl like disabl _ telemetri 1 that would be easier for the docker deploy 2026 08 22 14 43 bob good call i ll add that to the set loader 2026 08 22 14 46 diana i notic that even when it s off the app still tri to ping the updat server on startup doe that count a telemetri 2026 08 22 14 57 alic updat check are fine that s a secur requir but we shouldn t send ani machin id with that request 2026 08 22 15 13 bob it s a clean get request no header other than the current version string 2026 08 22 15 16 diana okay i ll verifi that with a packet captur tomorrow\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e8da02048a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-22-telemetry-opt-out-flag.md\", \"id\": \"f46eea4f85621821\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.28997589344581054, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.0920256306368722, \"vector_similarity\": 0.75185984, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-22-telemetry-opt-out-flag.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e8da02048a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-22-telemetry-opt-out-flag.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-22-telemetry-opt-out-flag.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1015, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:04:43\", \"token_count\": 320, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-24\\n\\n# Third-Party License Inventory Report\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2024\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-09; notes status through 2026-08-15)\\n\\nRetrospective report on the third-party license audit under CIPH-40.\\n\\n## Scope of the 2026-08-09 inventory\\n\\nAn audit of the dependency tree was run to catalog every third-party license in use ahead of release, flagging anything more restrictive than a permissive license.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-24\\n\\n# Third-Party License Inventory Report\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2024\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-09; notes status through 2026-08-15)\\n\\nRetrospective report on the third-party license audit under CIPH-40.\\n\\n## Finding and immediate action\\n\\nThe PDF-parsing dependency's license was flagged as a concern, and the team swapped it for a different parser library as a direct result of this inventory.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-24\\n\\n# Third-Party License Inventory Report\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2024\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-09; notes status through 2026-08-15)\\n\\nRetrospective report on the third-party license audit under CIPH-40.\\n\\n## Status as of 2026-08-15\\n\\nBecause this report is written retrospectively on 2026-08-21, it can note the later developments: the replacement parser adopted from the 08-09 finding was swapped in on 2026-08-11, then the task reopened on 2026-08-12 when that replacement turned out itself to be AGPL-licensed, which is not acceptable for the shipped dependency set. By 2026-08-15 the team was searching for an Apache- or MIT-licensed alternative; that search had not concluded as of this writing.\\n\\n**Source ID*