checklist can not close until that gate clear sourc id src gdoc 05 releas checklist v1 0 gate status draft owner evan document key doc 2005 last updat 2026 07 12 draft checklist for t011 releas v1 0 gate per the task s own depend list this draft depend on t001 through t006 and t010 status activ draft six of seven depend gate are met t005 remain open\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9b23eee8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-12-Release-Checklist.md\", \"id\": \"8bf53f4b1ae56706\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.32611118156578356, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.15274871652254793, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7306236, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-12-Release-Checklist.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9b23eee8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-12-Release-Checklist.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-12-Release-Checklist.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1077, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:40\", \"token_count\": 704, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-35\\n\\n# Crypto Sign-off: AES-256 At-Rest Encryption Pipeline\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2035\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-07\\n\\n## Sign-off Basis\\n\\nSecurity sign-off on the AES-256 at-rest pipeline was withheld until the fail-closed deletion behavior for interrupted redaction runs (T015) was confirmed Completed — an unencrypted partial output left on disk after a crash would have undermined the encryption guarantee entirely. With that dependency cleared, the sign-off proceeded against the pipeline as implemented.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-35\\n\\n# Crypto Sign-off: AES-256 At-Rest Encryption Pipeline\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2035\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-07\\n\\n## What Was Reviewed\\n\\n- AES-256-GCM authenticated encryption applied to every redacted output file before it is written to its final location.\\n\\n- Key handling confined to process memory; no plaintext key material written to disk or logs.\\n\\n- Confirmed the pipeline degrades safely (refuses to write plaintext) if key material is unavailable, consistent with the fail-closed contract from T015.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-35\\n\\n# Crypto Sign-off: AES-256 At-Rest Encryption Pipeline\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2035\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-07\\n\\n## Follow-up Noted at Sign-off\\n\\nOn machines without a hardware TPM, the volume key is still derived from a user passphrase via PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 at 100k iterations. This is not a blocker for the AES-256 pipeline sign-off itself, but Diana flagged it as a hardening follow-up: moving to Argon2id would meaningfully raise the cost of offline brute-force against weak passphrases on non-TPM hardware.\\n\\n*Status*: AES-256 at-rest pipeline signed off as Completed. Passphrase-derived key hardening (Argon2id) tracked separately as a pre-v1.0 hardening item, not a sign-off condition.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 35 crypto sign off ae 256 at rest encrypt pipelin owner diana document key doc 2035 last updat 2026 08 07 sign off basi secur sign off on the ae 256 at rest pipelin wa withheld until the fail close delet behavior for interrupt redact run t015 wa confirm complet an unencrypt partial output left on disk after a crash would have undermin the encrypt guarante entir with that depend clear the sign off proceed against the pipelin a implement sourc id src gdoc 35 crypto sign off ae 256 at rest encrypt pipelin owner diana document key doc 2035 last updat 2026 08 07 what wa review ae 256 gcm authent encrypt appli to everi redact output file befor it is written to it final locat key handl confin to process memori no plaintext key materi written to disk or log confirm the pipelin degrad safe refus to write plaintext if key materi is unavail consist with the fail close contract from t015 sourc id src gdoc 35 crypto sign off ae 256 at rest encrypt pipelin owner diana document key doc 2035 last updat 2026 08 07 follow up note at sign off on machin without a hardwar tpm the volum key is still deriv from a user passphras via pbkdf2 hmac sha256 at 100k iter this is not a blocker for the ae 256 pipelin sign off itself but diana flag it a a harden follow up move to argon2id would meaning rais the cost of offlin brute forc against weak passphras on non tpm hardwar status ae 256 at rest pipelin sign off a complet passphras deriv key harden argon2id track separ a a pre v1 0 harden item not a sign off condit\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e99eb05e8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-07-Local-Encryption-at-Rest-Security-Evaluation.md\", \"id\": \"3d30fbd4bb571642\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3239044184800054, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.13987004782857917, \"vector_similarity\": 0.75331795, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-07-Local-Encryption-at-Rest-Security-Evaluation.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e99eb05e8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-07-Local-Encryption-at-Rest-Security-Evaluation.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-07-Local-Encryption-at-Rest-Security-Evaluation.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1518, \"chunk_co