ected or an accepted local remediation is chosen.\\n\\n*Status*: Blocked on upstream rendering-library scaling math.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 49 technic report high dpi coordin scale upstream block owner diana document key doc 2049 last updat 2026 09 10 background earlier work 2026 08 17 reproduc misalign on 4k display follow on scale math 2026 08 19 wa check against the complet preview overlay coordin from t023 sourc id src gdoc 49 technic report high dpi coordin scale upstream block owner diana document key doc 2049 last updat 2026 09 10 find the scale error point to a defect in the upstream render librari s scale math no safe local fix ha been identifi yet sourc id src gdoc 49 technic report high dpi coordin scale upstream block owner diana document key doc 2049 last updat 2026 09 10 current status block t036 is block on that upstream librari issu local coordin work remain depend on t023 s overlay path but can not clear the gate until upstream scale is correct or an accept local remedi is chosen status block on upstream render librari scale math\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9c0f8ee8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-10-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Coordinates-Report.md\", \"id\": \"e9d46560d0ce6c2f\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.31696989633158207, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.15899975190226012, \"vector_similarity\": 0.6855669, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-10-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Coordinates-Report.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9c0f8ee8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-10-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Coordinates-Report.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-10-High-DPI-PDF-R